  "Groups": [
    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "DA1",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A and B, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.125) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate NOT-NAND\u0027 gate. Role in the full adder: Y = NAND(A, B): the shared first XOR stage of half-adder 1, instantiated once per consumer \u2014 feeds P1. The whole full adder composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction. Shared NAND-stages are instantiated once per consumer because the canvas wires one waveguide per pin; the fan-out of A, B, and Cin onto several gates happens at the logic layer.",
        "Identifier": "DA1",
